hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1111","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne sau deenaar ki thaili uthaaee aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Saal bhar elaan karo. To main ne saal bhar elaan kya aur use pehchaanne wala na paaya. Phir main Aap key paas aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Saal bhar elaan karo. To main ne elaan kya aur use pehchaanne wala na paaya. Phir main teesri martaba Aap key paas aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Uskey bartan aur uski ginti aur uski bandhan yaad rakkho. Phir agar uska maalik aaey (to dey do) warna us se faeda uthao. (Bukhari: 2426). Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raastey mein khajoor key paas se guzrey. Aap ne farmaya: Agar mujhey khauf na hota ke wo sadqey mein se hai to main use khaa leta. (2431). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1112","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas aata hun aur apne bistar par giri hui khajoor paata hun. To use khaaney key liye uthaata hun. Phir mujhey khauf hota hai ke wo sadqa ho. To use phenk deta hun. (Bukhari: 2432). Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi kisi aadmi key maweshiyon ka doodh uski ijazat key baghair na dohey. Kya tum mein se koi pasand karta hai ke uski baithak mein aaya jaey aur uska khazaana toda jaey aur uska khaana muntaqil kar diya jaey. Beshak unkey liye unkey maweshiyon key than unkey khaaney khazaana kartey hain. To koi kisi key maweshiyon ka doodh uski ijazat key baghair na dohey. (2435). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Maz aalim ki kitaab."
